# Placeholder Images Directory

This directory should contain your venue images. Replace these placeholders with actual photos:

- hero-placeholder.jpg (1920x1080px)
- gallery-1.jpg through gallery-12.jpg (1200x800px each)
- about-venue.jpg (1200x800px)

Recommended image optimization:
- Format: JPG or WebP
- Quality: 80-90%
- Use next/image for automatic optimization
